{
  "source": "Prompts/transformer-6.mp4",
  "duration": 224.4673125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.76,
      "text": "When you type a message to chat GBT, you use words, and it responds with words."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.56,
      "end": 9.28,
      "text": "Underneath, AI splits your text into small pieces, called tokens."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.24,
      "end": 14.4,
      "text": "Each token has an embedding, a row of numbers that represents its starting meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.24,
      "end": 19.54,
      "text": "AI works mathematically, but to make the connections easier to see, we will use whole words."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.78,
      "end": 21.22,
      "text": "Two problems."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.3,
      "end": 24.32,
      "text": "Please turn on the light means brightness."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.14,
      "end": 27.86,
      "text": "The empty suitcase felt light means not heavy."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.08,
      "end": 31.94,
      "text": "The cat was thirsty, so it drank the milk."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.68,
      "end": 33.38,
      "text": "It means cat."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.2,
      "end": 36.66,
      "text": "The milk was fresh, so the cat drank it."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.36,
      "end": 38.24,
      "text": "It means milk."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.24,
      "end": 41.34,
      "text": "The surrounding words help AI figure out the meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.64,
      "end": 47.38,
      "text": "This flowchart illustrates how earlier AI read text sequentially, one word at a time."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.0,
      "end": 48.9,
      "text": "Let's follow this sentence."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.88,
      "end": 52.66,
      "text": "The tired cat sat on the mat during the May rainstorm."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.14,
      "end": 54.08,
      "text": "It soon fell asleep."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.82,
      "end": 57.82,
      "text": "Notice the growing distance between cat and it."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.6,
      "end": 61.5,
      "text": "Earlier AI struggled to keep that connection in longer passages."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.44,
      "end": 64.62,
      "text": "That limitation set the stage for a new architecture."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.72,
      "end": 69.64,
      "text": "In 2017, eight researchers at Google published a paper called,"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.1,
      "end": 71.3,
      "text": "Attention is All You Need."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.86,
      "end": 75.34,
      "text": "It introduced the transformer, which is the T in chat GBT."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.7,
      "end": 78.9,
      "text": "This diagram shows a completely different mechanical approach."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.44,
      "end": 82.4,
      "text": "The transformer can process the tokens in your message at once."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.4,
      "end": 88.88,
      "text": "By taking in the complete message together, the word it can immediately draw on information from cat"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.88,
      "end": 91.26,
      "text": "bypassing the gap of the words in between."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.94,
      "end": 94.58,
      "text": "Ingesting the text simultaneously is only the first step."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.18,
      "end": 100.44,
      "text": "To understand a sentence, the AI must actively calculate which specific words matter,"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.88,
      "end": 103.04,
      "text": "using them to update the starting embeddings."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.46,
      "end": 107.04,
      "text": "This board shows two mechanisms updating a token's meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.69,
      "end": 113.34,
      "text": "First, attention weighs information from relevant words and blends it into the token's numbers."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.96,
      "end": 116.74,
      "text": "Notice the connection flowing from it to cat."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.68,
      "end": 122.76,
      "text": "Second, transformation uses learned patterns to further process those numbers."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.7,
      "end": 126.44,
      "text": "The surrounding words help update each token's numbers."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.2,
      "end": 131.02,
      "text": "Applying this to our examples shows how the transformer resolves meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.02,
      "end": 137.58,
      "text": "On the left, turn on, acts on the token light, pulling its mathematical meaning toward brightness."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.28,
      "end": 141.56,
      "text": "Below, empty establishes light as not heavy."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.34,
      "end": 143.56,
      "text": "It works similarly for pronouns."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.62,
      "end": 146.46,
      "text": "First, it points to the thirsty cat."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.28,
      "end": 148.14,
      "text": "Next, to the milk."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.08,
      "end": 154.66,
      "text": "The combination of attention and transformation is exactly how AI deduces which meaning fits."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.46,
      "end": 160.66,
      "text": "Because the transformer continually weighs relationships across the entire text simultaneously,"
    },
    {
      "start": 161.46,
      "end": 165.58,
      "text": "this same mathematical blending scales up to capture broader structural patterns,"
    },
    {
      "start": 165.72,
      "end": 170.22,
      "text": "allowing AI to interpret human nuances like sarcasm and idioms."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.84,
      "end": 176.14,
      "text": "Seeing all the text simultaneously introduces a critical flaw, losing the sequence."
    },
    {
      "start": 176.92,
      "end": 178.18,
      "text": "The words alone aren't enough."
    },
    {
      "start": 178.78,
      "end": 179.66,
      "text": "They're order matters too."
    },
    {
      "start": 180.34,
      "end": 182.14,
      "text": "This board contrasts two phrases."
    },
    {
      "start": 182.92,
      "end": 185.4,
      "text": "Dog bites man and man bites dog."
    },
    {
      "start": 186.26,
      "end": 192.58,
      "text": "Without positional information, these identical tokens and starting embeddings are completely ambiguous."
    },
    {
      "start": 193.32,
      "end": 197.84,
      "text": "They float without sequence, capable of describing two entirely different events."
    },
    {
      "start": 198.56,
      "end": 200.64,
      "text": "The solution is positional encoding."
    },
    {
      "start": 200.64,
      "end": 209.7,
      "text": "It acts as a numerical stamp, one, two, three, that helps the model keep track of every token's precise place in the sequence."
    },
    {
      "start": 210.46,
      "end": 213.94,
      "text": "Positional encoding tells the transformer where every token belongs."
    },
    {
      "start": 215.3,
      "end": 216.2,
      "text": "Attention is all you need."
    },
    {
      "start": 217.34,
      "end": 220.9,
      "text": "AI uses relationships between words to help interpret your message."
    }
  ],
